sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant API as Workflow API
  participant W as HogFlow writes
  participant IU as Integration usage
  participant PH as Analytics
  U->>API: Enable (asks for active)
  API->>API: serializer validates
  API->>W: enable(flow, validated_data, actor)
  W->>W: lock row
  W->>IU: senders_of(flow)
  alt every sender verified
    IU-->>W: all verified
    W->>W: save active, enable_requested_at = went_live_at = now
    W->>PH: hog_flow_enable_requested {outcome: active}
    W->>PH: hog_flow_activated {activated_by: user, seconds_waiting: 0}
  else a sender is unverified
    IU-->>W: 1 of 1 unverified
    W->>W: save waiting_for_domain, enable_requested_at/by
    W->>PH: hog_flow_enable_requested {outcome: waiting_for_domain}
  end
  W-->>API: saved status
  API-->>U: saved status, badge
